  "source_caption": "“𝘞𝘩𝘺 𝘢𝘳𝘦 𝘺𝘰𝘶 𝘸𝘦𝘢𝘳𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘵𝘩𝘢𝘵 𝘴𝘵𝘶𝘱𝘪𝘥 𝘣𝘶𝘯𝘯𝘺 𝘴𝘶𝘪𝘵?”⁣⁣ 🐰 \n⁣⁣\n“𝘞𝘩𝘺 𝘢𝘳𝘦 𝘺𝘰𝘶 𝘸𝘦𝘢𝘳𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘵𝘩𝘢𝘵 𝘴𝘵𝘶𝘱𝘪𝘥 𝘮𝘢𝘯 𝘴𝘶𝘪𝘵?”⁣⁣ 🧒🏻\n⁣⁣\nThroughout 𝐃𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐢𝐞 𝐃𝐚𝐫𝐤𝐨 (𝟐𝟎𝟎𝟏), Donnie struggles with questions about identity, reality, and existence itself, and whether his actions are truly his own. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nFrank’s seemingly ridiculous answer in this scene fits perfectly into a larger philosophical puzzle. He isn’t just a mysterious figure wearing a bunny suit. He is the relationship between time, death, and alternate realities. The bunny suit is a symbol of how little he, and we as viewers, truly understand about the world he’s experiencing.",
